.TH GEEKBENCH7-LINUX 1 "October 2026" "geekbench7-linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
geekbench7-linux \- manage unofficial packaging for official Geekbench 7 on Linux
.br
geekbench7 \- run official Geekbench 7 (passthrough)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geekbench7-linux
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I COMMAND
...
.br
.B geekbench7
[\fIGEEKBENCH OPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B geekbench7 wrapper
.I COMMAND
...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B geekbench7-linux
downloads and manages the official, unmodified Geekbench 7 Linux build from
Primate Labs' CDN. It never redistributes or patches Geekbench.
.PP
.B geekbench7
runs the official binary (default entry point for benchmarks). Use
.B geekbench7 wrapper
for the same management commands as
.BR geekbench7-linux .
.PP
Geekbench is made by Primate Labs (founder John Poole). This project is not
affiliated with Primate Labs. Please buy a license at
https://www.primatelabs.com/store/v7/ if you find Geekbench useful.
.SH WRAPPER COMMANDS
Available as
.B geekbench7-linux COMMAND
or
.B geekbench7 wrapper COMMAND\fR.
.TP
.B setup
Download and extract Geekbench 7 (requires
.B --accept-eula
on first run).
.TP
.B update
Refresh the pinned Geekbench version from the CDN.
.TP
.B doctor
Report install paths, arch and status.
.TP
.B about
Credits, thanks and disclaimer.
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove per-user Geekbench state (keeps the system package).
.TP
.B desktop install|remove
Install or remove a per-user menu entry.
.TP
.B version
Print the wrapper version.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://www.geekbench.com/
.br
https://github.com/ventura8/geekbench7-linux
